        "subject": "LU-20534 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_ONE_OBJ_SWAP flag",
        "message": "LU-20534 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_ONE_OBJ_SWAP flag\n\nReserve OBD_CONNECT2_ONE_OBJ_SWAP at 0x2000000000000ULL for swapping\nthe layout of a single stripe of a file.  Only the flag,\nobd_connect_names[] and the wire checks are added here so the value\ncan land before the feature patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I033e62f95c7cecc109ce9f5dba1eb32c0f31adee\n"
